              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NimbleChop9715"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved these cookies! When I first baked them thought they lacked flour. I however, did not bake the entire roll and they sat for about 3 days (don't think you need to let them sit that long) and they were out of this world. Flavors melded and I making them for my cookie swap.",
