            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer MacDonald"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Initially I felt these cookies were a little on the bland side eventhough my whole family liked them. I did however make a few changes to the recipe. First, the dough was too dry, so I added 2 TB of milk. Secondly, I could not find ground hazelnuts, so I tried to ground whole ones in my blender, but ended up with powdered hazelnuts. If I'd had larger pieces I think these would have been better. Lastly I frosted the cookies with Nutella which seemed to help a lot.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-22T15:42:14.110Z"
          },
          {
