            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "litg8r"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After reading the comments I added some vanilla extract and I think it was helpful to give these cookies more depth of flavor. The next time I make them I think I'll dip them halfway in melted chocolate and adhere the sprinkles to the chocolate.",
